38268>>>        Else Begin
38269>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38270>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38271>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38272>>>        End
38272>>>>
38272>>>    End_Procedure
